{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "13174b5e-25ad-867f-b250-b4b642ebfb33",
  "created_at": "2026-01-11T15:33:58-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Kwame Patel",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T15:32:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T15:32:16-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes. I know it's Sunday and City Hall's closed, so I'm glad somebody picks up this line. My name's Kwame Patel, I'm at 352 Chapel Street, up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T15:32:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Mr. Patel. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T15:32:30-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "After that coastal storm, the one that ended yesterday, I got a few inches of water in my cellar. Seeped right in along the wall. Twenty-some years in this house and that has never happened. Never. Which tells me something changed out there, and it wasn't me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T15:32:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few inches, okay. Is it still coming in, or has it stopped?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T15:32:50-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Stopped, mostly. Damp now. But the water out front is still pooled up by the curb, and that's what bothers me. There are kids cutting through here on the way to the park, and people walking dogs right along the edge of it. Somebody's going to step in it without seeing how deep it is. Not great."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T15:33:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fair to flag. Do you know if the drain at the corner is clogged or just overwhelmed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T15:33:15-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No idea. I'm not a drain expert, I'm a guy who runs a shop. I've been cutting everything I can lately, I even dropped my streaming subscription to save a few bucks, and now I'm looking at cellar repairs. So who do I call to get it checked? Somebody has to look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T15:33:33-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You called the right place. I'll put in a request for a crew to inspect the drain and the street out front, 352 Chapel. Crews are stretched after a storm, so it may be Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T15:33:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine, as long as someone actually comes. Do you need a number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T15:33:50-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T15:33:52-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0151."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T15:33:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Someone will be in touch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T15:33:56-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks, Denise."
    }
  ],
